In [[Prague]], two Strix were invoked by [[Zhalia Moon]] to defeat two [[Redcap]]s. {{Source|Words of Truth, Heart of Lies}} In the [[Paris Catacombs]], Zhalia invoked three Strix to defeat two [[Mindrone]] Titans and a [[Jokoul]] Titan. {{Source|Divide and Conquer}}

In Iceland, Zhalia invoked her Strix to put holes in the clouds, allowing the sun's light to come through and make the [[Rainbow Bridge]]. {{Source|The Legacy of Thor}} In the [[Temple of Thor]], Zhalia later invoked one Strix to help distract the [[Guardians of Thor]]. {{Source|Two Powers Become One}}

On [[Madea Island]], an illusion of Strix was invoked by an illusion of Zhalia but was defeated by [[Sophie]]'s [[Sabriel]]. {{Source|The Beautiful Trap}}

At the [[Temple of Poseidon]], Zhalia invoked two Strix to make holes in the gliders of [[Rassimov]]'s [[Suits]]. {{Source|The Unseen Guide}}
